{"key": "cis.quality_modes.t9_brief_grounding", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_modes", "label": "T9 brief grounding mode", "description": "off: the angle brief goes to the writer as written. r9: clauses of the brief the seed does not support are dropped before the writer sees it (AA-1049 R9). The env var stays an emergency override for one release (a badge on this page). Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["off", "r9"], "default_value": "off", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "medium", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": "T9_BRIEF_GROUNDING_MODE", "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_modes.t7_debate", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_modes", "label": "T7 debate mode", "description": "rank: flagged Slate candidates are ordered after unflagged ones, none dropped (AA-1079). cut: flagged candidates are cut, worst first, up to the cut fraction below (AA-631). The env var stays an emergency override for one release (a badge on this page). Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["rank", "cut"], "default_value": "rank", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "medium", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": "T7_DEBATE_MODE", "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_modes.t2_judge_gate", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_modes", "label": "T2 judge gate", "description": "The score a T2 tenant rewrite is gated on: brand_fit (brand fit alone, mission logged as a diagnostic), brand_fit_mission (brand fit capped when the mission is absent) or combined (the pre-AA-792 rule). Seeded from the worker's Terraform value (brand_fit; the code default was brand_fit_mission). The worker env var is no longer read (removed from Terraform in lane L6). Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["brand_fit_mission", "brand_fit", "combined"], "default_value": "brand_fit", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "high", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": null, "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_modes.t3_background_facts", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_modes", "label": "T3 accepts background facts", "description": "On: T3 grounding accepts past years, centuries and elevations of named places as background, never trip activities, services or times the source lacks (AA-793). Seeded from the worker's Terraform value (on; the code default was off). The worker env var is no longer read (removed from Terraform in lane L6). Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "bool", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": null, "default_value": true, "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "medium", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": null, "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_claims.rules_hypothetical", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_claims", "label": "Claim verdict: hypothetical framing", "description": "What the F9 v2 claim rules do with hypothetical framing that names no concrete trip detail (writing policy D4): pass, warn or fail. Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["pass", "warn", "fail"], "default_value": "warn", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "high", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": null, "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_claims.rules_uncited_background", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_claims", "label": "Claim verdict: uncited place background", "description": "What the F9 v2 claim rules do with background about a named place that cites no line (writing policy D1): pass, warn or fail. Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["pass", "warn", "fail"], "default_value": "warn", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "high", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": null, "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_claims.f9_trip_promise", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_claims", "label": "F9 verdict: trip promise", "description": "hold or warn when the F9 judge reports a trip promise (activity, service, time or view the source lacks) (the interim F9 policy, writing policy D6). Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["hold", "warn"], "default_value": "hold", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "high", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": null, "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_claims.f9_unsupported_other", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_claims", "label": "F9 verdict: unsupported other", "description": "hold or warn when the F9 judge reports another unsupported claim (place background, a generalisation) (the interim F9 policy, writing policy D6). Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["hold", "warn"], "default_value": "warn", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "high", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": null, "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
{"key": "cis.quality_claims.f9_fact_check_unquoted", "app": "cis", "area": "quality_claims", "label": "F9 verdict: fact check unquoted", "description": "hold or warn when the F9 judge reports a fact-check finding with phrases but no named claim (the interim F9 policy, writing policy D6). Evidence required: an eval or golden-set run id, or a $0 replay of stored pieces that shows the new verdicts.", "value_type": "enum", "unit": null, "min_value": null, "max_value": null, "allowed_values": ["hold", "warn"], "default_value": "warn", "scope_kind": "platform", "impact": "high", "approval": "maker_checker", "evidence_required": true, "env_override": null, "cache_s": 30, "enforced": true},
